This product is a substantially rewritten fork of MemPalace/mempalace
(https://github.com/MemPalace/mempalace, formerly milla-jovovich/mempalace;
MIT license, Copyright (c) 2026 MemPalace Contributors). The fork replaces
the storage backend (ChromaDB -> LanceDB), adds language-aware code mining,
incremental re-mining, export/import, code search, and an extensive test
suite.

